        _e("kv_math_discrete", "Discrete Math for CS", "math", "# Sets\nA = {1,2,3}, B = {2,3,4}\nA ∪ B = {1,2,3,4}      # Union\nA ∩ B = {2,3}          # Intersection\nA - B = {1}            # Difference\n|A × B| = |A| × |B|   # Cartesian product\n\n# Combinatorics\nPermutations: P(n,r) = n!/(n-r)!  # Order matters\nCombinations: C(n,r) = n!/(r!(n-r)!)  # Order doesn't matter\nWith repetition: C(n+r-1, r)\n\n# Probability\nP(A or B) = P(A) + P(B) - P(A and B)\nP(A|B) = P(A and B) / P(B)  # Bayes\nExpected value: E[X] = Σ x·P(x)\nVariance: Var(X) = E[X²] - (E[X])²\n\n# Graph Theory\nEuler's formula: V - E + F = 2 (planar graphs)\nHandshaking lemma: Σ degree(v) = 2|E|\nTree: connected acyclic graph, |E| = |V| - 1\nComplete graph K_n: n(n-1)/2 edges\n\n# Logic\nDe Morgan: ¬(A∧B) = ¬A∨¬B, ¬(A∨B) = ¬A∧¬B\nContrapositive: (A→B) ≡ (¬B→¬A)\nProof by contradiction, induction, pigeonhole principle", ["math","discrete","combinatorics","probability","graph-theory","logic"]),
